  "solution": {
    "text": "<img height=\"99\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/xkfrzzkewcjavrjzyqvclshtgloveklivklucbgcrpantyanft.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"227\" /><br /><br />Particle taken <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> time to reach from 0 to <math><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi></math> and also <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> to reach from <math><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi></math> to <math><mn>4</mn><mi>h</mi></math> and yet again <math><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> time from <math><mn>4</mn><mi>h</mi></math> to <math><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
